{"text":"寶光寺，在西陽門外御道北。有三層浮圖一所，以石為基，形制甚古，畫工雕刻，□□□□。隱士趙逸見而歎曰：「晉朝石塔寺，今為寶光寺也。」人問其故。逸曰：「晉朝三十二寺盡皆湮滅，唯此寺獨存。」指園中一處，曰：「此是浴堂。前五步，應有一井。」眾僧掘之，果得屋及井焉。井雖填塞，磚口如初。浴堂下猶有石數十枚。當時園地平衍，果菜蔥青，莫不歎息焉。\n    園中有一海，號咸池。葭菼被岸，菱荷覆水，青松翠竹，羅生其旁。京邑士子，至於良辰美日，休沐告歸，徵友命朋，來遊此寺。雷車接軫，羽蓋成陰。或置酒林泉，題詩花圃，折藕浮瓜，以為興適。\n    普泰末，雍州刺史隴西王爾朱天光總士馬於此寺。寺門無何都崩，天光見而惡之。其年天光戰敗，斬於東市也。\n","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Construct","term":"浴堂","refId":null,"text":"浴堂","start":103,"end":105},{"name":"Udef_Construct","term":"井","refId":null,"text":"井","start":113,"end":114},{"name":"Udef_Construct","term":"井","refId":null,"text":"井","start":125,"end":126},{"name":"Udef_Construct","term":"井","refId":null,"text":"井","start":128,"end":129},{"name":"Udef_Construct","term":"浴堂","refId":null,"text":"浴堂","start":138,"end":140},{"name":"Udef_Garden","term":"咸池","refId":null,"text":"咸池","start":178,"end":180},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"葭","refId":null,"text":"葭","start":181,"end":182},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"菼","refId":null,"text":"菼","start":182,"end":183},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"菱","refId":null,"text":"菱","start":186,"end":187},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"荷","refId":null,"text":"荷","start":187,"end":188},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"松","refId":null,"text":"松","start":192,"end":193},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"竹","refId":null,"text":"竹","start":194,"end":195},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"酒","refId":null,"text":"酒","start":240,"end":241},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"藕","refId":null,"text":"藕","start":250,"end":251},{"name":"Udef_Products","term":"瓜","refId":null,"text":"瓜","start":252,"end":253},{"name":"Date","term":"普泰末","refId":null,"text":"普泰末","start":264,"end":267},{"name":"Udef_Governor","term":"雍州刺史","refId":null,"text":"雍州刺史","start":268,"end":272},{"name":"LocName","term":"隴西","refId":"hvd_70003","text":"隴西","start":272,"end":274},{"name":"PersonName","term":"爾朱天光","refId":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/zh-tw/%E7%88%BE%E6%9C%B1%E5%A4%A9%E5%85%89","text":"爾朱天光","start":275,"end":279},{"name":"Udef_Products","